OL,3,GNEWSAWiddecombe suspect had 'particular
OL,4,Ahostility to Reform', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast week, Kerry, who had already been
OL,7,Fcharged with Widdecombe's murder in
OL,8,FJuly, was charged with a second offence
OL,9,Fof preparing terrorist acts.
